+# GitHub issue implementation ledger
+
+19 October 2026. All 11 issues and comments reviewed. This is an unreleased work ledger. Issues remain open until delivered acceptance criteria are verified. The owner explicitly excluded launch work and PP-system changes.
+
+| Issue | Scope | Status |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| [#1](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/1) | [Bug] Flashlight Not Working & Aim Assist Tablet Shake Fix | Native Flashlight rendering and preserved mod metadata implemented; 37 presentation assertions and six capped gameplay cycles passed. An additional active-gameplay PNG capture confirms the visible field and masked exterior. Tablet movement jitter has a bounded Maple V1 correction; physical tablet feel remains unqualified. |
+| [#2](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/2) | [Bug / Balance] Maple V1 Aim Assist - Overpowered Auto-Aim and Cursor Teleportation | Maple V1 guidance is bounded by actual movement and allowed strength. 20,315 native assertions passed; Max Assist and V3 guidance branches were not retuned. Packaging pending. |
+| [#3](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/3) | [Proposed Balance Adjustment] Bosh PP System - Timewarp Multiplier Correction & General PP Rebalancing | Excluded by owner: do not change the PP system. Experimental edits were reverted byte-for-byte before delivery. Published formulas, rewards and historical scores remain unchanged. |
+| [#4](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/4) | [Feature] Full .OSR Replay Support - Import, Playback, Export & Assist Compatibility | Bounded OSR import is wired to Standard and supplied modes; native Results/local-play export includes captured settings and exact canonical companions. New recordings capture actual RNG seeds. 37 exchange assertions passed; older recordings remain readable. The dense one-judgment parity defect remains unresolved, so the issue stays open. |
+| [#5](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/5) | [Feature] In-Game Clipping & Video Encoding Support - Third-Party Capture Compatibility & Performance Optimisation | OBS 32.2.2 successfully hooked and recorded the real OpenGL client using shared textures. The nonblank image was visually reviewed; 1,112 frames output, zero encoder skips, one OBS render stall. OBS scene export and discoverable recording setup added; 21 setup assertions passed. Vendor auto-catalogues and native encoding are not certified. |
+| [#6](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/6) | [Feature] Additional osu! Game Mode Support - Taiko, Catch & Mania | Owner approved supplied Bosh Taiko/Catch/Mania with McOsu Standard. Local routing/storage implemented; 109 CPU assertions and 33 real-client lifecycle/replay/native-handover assertions passed. Actual replay judgments/combo/score matched in all three modes; no handled exceptions in the final run. Wider physical controls qualification remains pending. Mode PP is unavailable under the PP freeze. |
+| [#7](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/7) | [Feature] Autopilot PP Support - Bosh PP System & Imported PP Calculators | Deferred under the owner's PP freeze. No AP PP award or calculator formula changed. |
+| [#8](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/8) | [Feature] Kawata.pw Server Integration - Score Submission Framework & Integrated Cheat Limits | Pinned Kawata source reviewed; live implemented profile/standings/best/recent/map leaderboard requests passed. Scoped sign-in transport, provider UI and configurable eligibility framework added; 26 checks passed. Actual account sign-in, current numeric server limits and native replay/submission proof remain unqualified. Upload stays disabled; issue remains open. |
+| [#9](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/9) | hlep | Excluded by owner: leave launch troubleshooting alone. |
+| [#10](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/10) | (Temporary Documentation) Fix: Boshsu Not Launching on Windows | Excluded by owner: leave launch troubleshooting alone. |
+| [#11](https://github.com/hsob2nd/Boshsu/issues/11) | new feature request | Songs linking and safe skin-folder import implemented. 24 filesystem assertions and 54 actual-shell assertions passed across six viewport/scale cases. Publication pending. |
